criptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":408,"digest":"sha256:087d729758ffba1dd9c6eeb3f61dca3dc7bdc41f3adbd124196d4650ab38d132","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-16T13:25:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T13:25:25Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ysya/sshelter/releases/download/v1.0.0-14/SSHelter_universal.app.tar.gz.sig"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ysya/sshelter/tarball/v1.0.0-14","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ysya/sshelter/zipball/v1.0.0-14","body":"- Unify the Records workspace with shared page headings, spacing, list rows and host/key details. Hosts open in list view by default and remember the chosen view.\n- Add a collapsible sidebar and independently collapsible Group trees, with remembered state, labelled icon navigation and reversible transitions.\n- Add System and Reduced motion preferences. System follows the OS preference; Reduced keeps navigation and dialogs responsive without visible movement.\n- Use shared sections and action bars for host/Group editing, sync setup, SSH configuration import and migration. Preserve draft confirmation, explicit private-key copy choices, reviewed previews and resumable operations.\n- Give server identity, SSH authentication and agent approval windows a consistent layout with visible decision buttons. Preserve their arming, busy and expiry checks.\n- Improve keyboard focus when closing details, keeping or discarding edits, saving a sync code and completing or cancelling a review.\n\nThis beta contains the main workspace and workflow redesign. Legacy surfaces and some secondary settings/deployment screens still have follow-up work. macOS Development WebView checks and browser layout checks were completed; manual visual acceptance on Windows and Linux remains pending.\n"}